Backport of upstream PR #442 robustness to the 2.3.0 AT driver: byte-level
reads with a wall-clock deadline (no fgets hang), advisory (non-fatal)
capability probes, and acceptance of a bare CCHO channel number. Fixes eUICC
access on Fibocom FM350-GL.

--- a/driver/apdu/at.c
+++ b/driver/apdu/at.c
@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@
 #include <lpac/utils.h>
 
 #include <dirent.h>
+#include <poll.h>
